  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Institute of Non-traditional Security of Viet Nam for cybersecurity capacity building &amp; training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;Supporting the establishment of a cybersecurity education center within INS and developing a training curriculum to enhance the country&apos;s cybersecurity capacity and cyber threat response capabilities.&#xc218;&#xd61c;&#xc790;&#xc758; &#xc0ac;&#xc774;&#xbc84;&#xbcf4;&#xc548; &#xae30;&#xc220; &#xbc0f; &#xc2e4;&#xbb34; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xc774; &#xccb4;&#xacc4;&#xc801;&#xc73c;&#xb85c; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;&#xb428;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build an online/offline cybersecurity practice lab based at the Institute of Non-traditional Security(INS), Develop and launch the operation of the cyber range at INS, Provide training course to improve professional qualifications for teaching staff specialized in Cybersecurity, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
